<title>USA: Storage Computer names Louney CFO.</title>
<headline>Storage Computer names Louney CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NASHUA, N.H. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Storage Computer Corp said Monday it had named James Louney as chief financial officer and treasurer.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Storage Computer, Louney served as chief financial officer at Micracor Inc, a venture to develop and manufacture high-power microchip lasers and pumps for the communications industry.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said Louney fills a newly created position.</p>
</text>
